{"articleNo":"495677","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=495677&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 2024-2학기 독서인증제 도서목록 조정(제외) 안내 및 독서인증 신청 불가 일정 안내","writer":"도서관","writeDate":"2024.08.12","hit":"11671","attachments":[{"name":"제외 예정인 독서인증제 도서(1차) 84종.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=495677&attachNo=136672"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">도서관에서 운영 중인&nbsp;<strong>독서인증제</strong>의</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><strong>도서 목록</strong>이</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><strong>2024-2</strong></span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><strong>학기부터 조정될 예정</strong>입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">기존 독서인증제 도서 중&nbsp;<b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">2024-2</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">학기부터 제외될 도서 목록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">(1</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">차-파일첨부</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><b>)</b> 및&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.266667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>독서인증 신청 불가 일정</b></span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -14.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">을 다음과 같이 안내하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 참고하여 독서인증제에 참여해주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">- 독서인증제 시스템 수정기간에는 학부생의 독서인증 신청이 불가합니다. (모든 도서 신청 불가)</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">- 기존 독서인증제 도서로 독서인증 신청을 준비하고 있는 학생은 아래 안내된 <b>독서인증제 시스템 수정기간 전</b>에</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">&nbsp; <b>신청</b>을 마무리해주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.266667px; text-indent: -19.2px; font-size: 16px;\">-</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.266667px; text-indent: -19.2px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(231, 76, 60); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: -19.2px;\">첨부한 목록의 도서는 2024-2학기부터 독서인증제 도서에서 제외되므로&nbsp;</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16px; text-indent: -14.4pt; color: rgb(231, 76, 60); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.266667px; text-indent: -19.2px;\">독서인증제 시스템 수정기간 이후에도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;독서인증 신청 불가</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. 1차 조정(제외) 도서: 기존 독서인증제 도서 중 84종(파일 첨부)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></span></span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">※&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">첨부한 조정(제외) 도서 외에도</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: -19.2px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;지도교수 모집이 안될 경우 추가로 제외될 예정임</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 19px; margin-right: 7px; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. 조정사유</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 최근&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4</span></span>년간<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(2020</span></span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">~2023</span></span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></span>연평균 독서인증&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1.0</span></span>건 미만<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(54</span></span>종<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></span>도서 제외</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span>시대흐름<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></span>저자 중복 및 영역 등을 고려</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>3</strong>.&nbsp;</span></span><strong>반영일정</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>(</strong></span></span><strong>예정</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>)</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span>독서인증제 지도교수 대상 도서 변경 신청 접수<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>2024. 8. 9.(</strong></span></span><strong>금</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>) ~ 8. 18.(</strong></span></span><strong>일</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>)</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><strong>독서인증제 시스템 수정</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>2024. 8. 26.(</strong></span></span><strong>월</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>) ~ 9. 1.(</strong></span></span><strong>일</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>)</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-left: 47px; text-indent: -34.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\">※&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60);\"><strong>해당 기간에는 학부생 독서인증 신청 불가</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 32px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span>조정 목록을 반영하여 독서인증제 운영<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>2024. 9. 2.(</strong></span></span><strong>월</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>) ~</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">첨부한 조정(제외) 도서는&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2024-2</span></strong></span></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학기부터 독서인증제 신청</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span></strong></span></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학부생</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">및 지도</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span></strong></span></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">지도교수</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span><strong style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -46.5333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">불가</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 32px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><br></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; margin-right: 7px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 32px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"15699\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
